          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
          "details": "改職方員外郎。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hiximaw4ktfz",
      "text": "屯田郎中",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "《宋史》卷三百〇七·楊覃傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
          "details": "咸平初，遷屯田郎中、三門發運使。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixia8mnfojl",
      "text": "陝西轉運使",
      "sources": [
